    "title": "Special Weather Statement by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "21 minutes ago Check NWS updates here\nEffective: 2026-04-22 22:57:00 CDT Expires: 2026-04-22 23:30:00 CDT Urgency: Expected Severity: Moderate Certainty: Observed Instruction: If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building. Target Area: McPherson At 1057 PM CDT, Doppler radar was tracking strong thunderstorms along a line extending from Ashley to 7 miles northwest of Leola to 6 miles northwest of Plainview Colony. Movement was northeast at 45 mph.\nHAZARD...Wind gusts of 50 to 55 mph and pea size hail.\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\nIMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around unsecured objects. Minor hail damage to vegetation is possible.\nLocations impacted include... Leola, Spring Creek Colony, Forbes, Long Lake, and Elm Lake.",
